Contents
--------

  tts_b6369a24.safetensors   the model weights
  tokenizer.model            SentencePiece tokenizer
  embeddings/<voice>.safetensors
                             precomputed per-voice conditioning

SHA256SUMS carries a checksum for every file above. Verify after
downloading:

  sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS
